---
/*
  An illustrative elevation of a wall in thin line: a standing figure, a sofa,
  and three works at their own scale (a statement canvas, an oversized canvas,
  a triptych) hung on one eye line. It shows why scale is the first decision.
  Labelled illustrative wherever it appears; it is not a drawing of a real room
  and carries no measurements.
*/
---
<svg
  class="mp-svg cc-elevation"
  viewBox="0 0 760 340"
  style="--tm:22px"
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="cc-elev-title cc-elev-desc"
  focusable="false"
>
  <title id="cc-elev-title">Illustrative wall elevation</title>
  <desc id="cc-elev-desc">
    A wall drawn in thin line with a standing figure at the left, a sofa below the middle, and three works hung on one
    eye line: a single statement canvas, an oversized canvas and a triptych of three panels.
  </desc>

  <!-- Wall: ceiling, skirting and floor, and the eye line the works hang on -->
  <path class="l-faint" d="M0 24H760" />
  <path class="l-faint" d="M0 292H760" />
  <path class="l" d="M0 300H760" />
  <path class="l-dash" d="M0 150H760" />
  <text class="t-soft t-small t-end t-minor" x="752" y="142">EYE LEVEL</text>

  <!-- A standing figure for scale -->
  <circle class="l" cx="64" cy="140" r="11" />
  <path class="l" d="M48 158Q64 152 80 158L84 226H44Z" />
  <path class="l" d="M54 226V300M74 226V300" />
  <path class="l-soft" d="M48 160L40 214M80 160L88 214" />

  <!-- A statement canvas -->
  <rect class="fill" x="150" y="80" width="100" height="140" />
  <rect class="l" x="150" y="80" width="100" height="140" />
  <rect class="l-faint" x="158" y="88" width="84" height="124" />
  <text class="t-soft t-small t-mid t-minor" x="200" y="324">STATEMENT</text>

  <!-- An oversized canvas, a sofa below it -->
  <rect class="fill" x="290" y="60" width="250" height="180" />
  <rect class="l" x="290" y="60" width="250" height="180" />
  <rect class="l-faint" x="298" y="68" width="234" height="164" />
  <rect class="l-soft" x="350" y="266" width="180" height="34" />
  <path class="l-soft" d="M350 282H530" />
  <text class="t-soft t-small t-mid t-minor" x="415" y="324">OVERSIZED</text>

  <!-- A triptych -->
  <rect class="fill" x="580" y="75" width="46" height="150" />
  <rect class="l" x="580" y="75" width="46" height="150" />
  <rect class="fill" x="634" y="75" width="46" height="150" />
  <rect class="l" x="634" y="75" width="46" height="150" />
  <rect class="fill" x="688" y="75" width="46" height="150" />
  <rect class="l" x="688" y="75" width="46" height="150" />
  <text class="t-soft t-small t-mid t-minor" x="657" y="324">TRIPTYCH</text>
</svg>
